{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>CleanBite 是一款專為家庭廚師與國際美食愛好者設計的食譜整理工具，能一鍵從網頁匯入食譜，去除彈出視窗、影片廣告與冗長故事，讓您專注於烹飪。目前限時免費，原價 US $5.95，下載請至 App Store。</p>\n\n<h2>智能整理食譜</h2>\n<p>CleanBite 提供一鍵匯入功能，可從 Safari 或任何 URL 提取食譜，自動儲存照片並支援離線閱讀。內建翻譯功能支援法文、中文、西班牙文等語言，使用 Apple 裝置端翻譯，無需 API 密鑰。烹飪模式提供大字體、逐步導航、計時器與保持螢幕喚醒。智慧購物清單自動合併重複項目，並按貨架分類。可調整份量、規劃每週菜單、iCloud 同步，且零廣告、零追蹤。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-859-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-860-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-861-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-862-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-863-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-864-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：CleanBite</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-15T10:18:44.622871+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":343,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}